   "x": "About 100 Adivasis from eight villages built the 100-metre wooden bridge between Lothugedda and Boyapadu in Chintapalli mandal, ASR district, during 8-15 August 2026. The earlier Panchayat Raj bridge there had been washed away in 2024, and the T. Korukonda bridge was a separate one built a year earlier."
