   "lines": [
    "20:2:1"
   ],
   "x": "Kotadibba at Gottiprolu village in Tirupati district was declared a Monument of National Importance; it covers about 24.22 acres and is protected under the AMASR Act, 1958. Pandrangi is Alluri Sitarama Raju's birthplace and the Kakinada museum is a manuscript museum."
  },
